- Imports seen in test files: `import {test} from 'node:test';` and `import assert from 'node:assert/strict';`, `import PQueue from '../source/index.js';` (`:10` in `test/basic.ts`), helpers from `'./helpers.js'`.
- `test/helpers.ts` exports `flush()`, `tick(t, ms)`, `countTimers()`, and `FifoQueue` (a custom queue ignoring priorities; `enqueue` stores `{run, id}`, `dequeue` shifts, `remove(id)` finds by id).
